 7 December 1989 open FIGGY BAR. The question for the night: With all the
 arguments over 'Which Architecture' have we given up on the concept of
 Forth as a virtual machine ? Good/Bad/Don't care ?
 Other items discussed included various O/S's, block vs text,Harris contest,
 SigForth ACM newsletter and late FORML ad, John Hall guest conference on
 December 14, and a LOT of bad puns.

